			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Dol Amroth -  Apps open for Many Classes! Updated 10/18/04 &nbsp;(Read 493 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=551" title="View the profile of beckah">beckah</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=551"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1174.msg11595#msg11595"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1174.msg11595#msg11595">Dol Amroth -  Apps open for Many Classes! Updated 10/18/04</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 05, 2004, 11:23:27 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Dol Amroth is looking for a few more people to join us in exploring GoD and OoW. We are specifically looking for people that know their class well, enjoy playing it, and love to raid.<br /><br />All apps must be flagged for Kod&#039;Taz as well as be at least level 69. Apps will only be open for a short time, so act now!<br /><br />1-2 Bards - 150 aa<br />1 Beastlord - 6500 HP/6500 Mana 350 aa<br />Clerics - 150 aa<br />1 Druid - 6000 HP/7000 Mana 450 aa<br />1 Magician - 250 aa<br />1 Paladin - 8000 HP/6500 Mana 300 aa<br />1-2 Rogues - 6500 HP 250 aa. <br />1 Shadowknight - 7500 HP 6500 Mana 400 aa<br />1 Shaman - 5500 HP/6500 Mana 350 aa<br />1-2 Warriors - 250 aa (all defensive aa), 11000hp raid buffed<br />1 Wizard - 4200 HP/6500 Mana 300 aa<br /><br /><br />For more information please visit our website: <a href="http://www.battlezinc.com/dolamroth/" target="_blank">http://www.battlezinc.com/dolamroth/</a><br />or talk to one of the following people in game: Beckah, Stargazeron, or Phad.<br />You can also email myself at <a href="mailto:beckahx@yahoo.com">beckahx@yahoo.com</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: October 18, 2004, 11:49:20 pm by beckah</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
